1. THE NOTICES: The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall
   be included in all copies or substantial portions of the Software.

2. ANTI-CHEATER RESTRICTIONS:
   (a) Permitted Educational & Fair Play Use: The Software MAY be used for homework
       assistance, step-by-step guidance, diagnostic feedback, error
       correction, or legitimate gameplay enhancement (e.g., custom HUDs, single-player mods),
       provided the user exhibits a genuine, non-zero effort to actually learn the concepts
       or play the game fairly.
   (b) Prohibited Dishonesty & Exploitation: The Software SHALL NOT be used to
       ghostwrite solutions, execute automated submission of graded tasks, facilitate
       cheating on any exam, quiz, test, or homework assignment, OR to develop, run, or
       distribute aimbots, wallhacks, macros, scripts, or cheats in any multiplayer video game.
       No one likes cheaters.

3. VIDEO GAME CHEATING RESTRICTIONS:
   (a) Absolute Video Game Prohibition: Except as provided in Section 3(b), the Software
       SHALL NOT be integrated into, compiled with, or executed alongside any software designed
       to compromise competitive integrity in video games (including, but not limited to, FPS,
       MOBA, Battle Royale, or MMORPG titles).
   (b) Exclusive Valorant Exemption: Notwithstanding Section 2(b) and Section 3(a), if the
       Software is used for the express purpose of video game cheating, it MAY ONLY be
       incorporated into cheats for Riot Games' Valorant (regardless of how mathematically
       impossible, absurd, or guaranteed to be instantly nuked by Riot Vanguard that may be).

